===Etymology 2===
{{senseid|tag=p|fi|ebb}}
Borrowed from {{der|fi|gem-pro|*flōduz}} (compare {{cog|de|Flut}}, {{cog|sv|flod}}) and derived with {{suffix|fi||-e}}. Originally meant flood or high tide.

